<title>HONG KONG: Yip's Hang Cheung year net jumps 285 pct.</title>
<headline>Yip's Hang Cheung year net jumps 285 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   11.3     vs  2.9</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    3.5	vs  nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	vs  8.04 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    53.03    vs  13.77</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,319.84 vs  1,514.80</p>
<p>    Company name		 Yip's Hang Cheung (Holdings) Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  August 28 to September 3</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   September 12</p>
<p>NOTE - Yip's Hang Cheung is a paint manufacturer.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 5.5 H.K. cents (including an interim dividend of two cents) vs 1.5 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368.  http://www.hk97.com</p>
</text>
